<title>USA: Vanstar Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Vanstar Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTON, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended January 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.17     loss	 $0.24</p>
<p> Net profit		 7,520     loss	 7,537</p>
<p> Revs		     527,542		  446,862</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  44,234		   31,249</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.65   profit	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net profit		28,361   profit	   728</p>
<p> Revs		   1,630,365		1,319,159</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  43,393		   32,972</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 results include effect of a special provision for doubtful accounts of $20 million for a receivable from Merisel Corp. Excluding the charge, net income would have been $0.16 per share for Q3 1996 and $0.40 per share for the nine months ended January 31, 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
